{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X 的感受短语有时堆叠过密，意象连续跳转，个别段落容易让观众顾着读感受而忽略音乐和叙事。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X 的重点词加亮、话与感受分层，以及感受按音乐节点出现，让观众能快速抓住叙事转折，同时不必一次处理所有信息。它把人物从害怕暴露需要、渴望亲近、担心失去，到接受不确定性的心理因果拆得更清楚，水波、船、声线和呼吸等感受也更紧密地跟随音乐变化。Y 的叙述更连贯自然，部分身体感受也更直观，但长句不利于听音乐时快速抓重点，且个别感受加入了原叙事没有充分支持的情色意味，削弱了情绪表达的准确性。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9cd5ea3d-6414-41fb-9dbb-ababaacaf5ff", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T193154724265Z", "elapsed_seconds": 64.438, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T19:32:59.174259+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "092c451a0adf0ff595cd0ffe914622e7e2b1ef04e76bf88232fa180379f1c5b0", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt